KONOHAGAKURE — PERSONAL FILE COVER LETTER

Welcome to your personal shinobi file.

This section of your record holds the documents that are yours to keep and revisit throughout your career: your personal ninja way statement, your Will of Fire pledge, and any personal correspondence you choose to lodge with the Administration Building.

Unlike your identity, medical, and performance sections — which are maintained by the village for operational purposes — the personal section belongs to you as a member of the Leaf family. You may update your ninja way statement at any milestone: graduation, promotion, or a defining mission.

Keep this file current. It is a small mirror of the shinobi you are becoming under the Will of Fire.

— Administration Building, Ninja Registration Desk
